"block text-sm font-semibold">Utilities</span><span class="text-muted-foreground block truncate text-xs">Water · Gas · Local utilities</span></span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right text-muted-foreground group-hover:text-foreground ml-auto h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-hover:translate-x-0.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></section><section class="relative isolate py-16 sm:py-24 lg:py-28 bg-muted/40"><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-10" style="background:radial-gradient(ellipse 55% 45% at 85% 100%, rgb(17 17 17 / 0.05), transparent 70%)"></div><div class="container-default"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center"><div class="mb-4 flex justify-center"><span class="chip-brand inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em]"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-foreground"></span>A day on the system</span></div><h2 class="text-balance text-3xl font-semibold sm:text-4xl lg:text-[42px] lg:leading-[1.08]">The same moments, run on Business Operations.</h2><p class="mt-4 text-pretty text-base text-muted-foreground sm:text-lg">Three ordinary situations your team handles every week — how they go today, and how they go once the system is live.</p></div><div class="mt-12 grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-3"><article class="border-border bg-card flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border shadow-sm"><h3 class="border-border border-b px-6 py-4 text-base font-semibold tracking-tight">A won deal becomes a dispatch</h3><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col gap-4 p-6"><div><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] text-rose-700 uppercase"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clock h-3.5 w-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"></path></svg>Today</div><p class="text-muted-foreground mt-1.5 text-sm">Sales emails the order to the warehouse, the warehouse ships from its own sheet, and finance invoices from a forwarded thread.</p></div><div class="bg-brand-50 ring-brand-200 mt-auto rounded-xl p-4 ring-1"><div class="text-brand-800 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sparkles h-3.5 w-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z"></path><path d="M20 2v4"></path><path d="M22 4h-4"></path><circle cx="4" cy="20" r="2"></circle></svg>With <!-- -->Business Operations</div><p class="text-foreground/85 mt-1.5 text-sm">The deal closes in CRM, WMS picks, packs and dispatches against it, and Finance raises the invoice and tracks it in AR.</p></div></div></article><article class="border-border bg-card flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border shadow-sm"><h3 class="border-border border-b px-6 py-4 text-base font-semibold tracking-tight">An online order meets store stock</h3><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col gap-4 p-6"><div><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] text-rose-700 uppercase"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clock h-3.5 w-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"></path></svg>Today</div><p class="text-muted-foreground mt-1.5 text-sm">The website takes an order for an item the warehouse sold yesterday, and the refund is sorted out over the phone.</p></div><div class="bg-brand-50 ring-brand-200 mt-auto rounded-xl p-4 ring-1"><div class="text-brand-800 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sparkles h-3.5 w-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z"></path><path d="M20 2v4"></path><path d="M22 4h-4"></path><circle cx="4" cy="20" r="2"></circle></svg>With <!-- -->Business Operations</div><p class="text-foreground/85 mt-1.5 text-sm">E-Commerce sells from WMS stock, the order is picked and dispatched from the warehouse, and delivery tracking shows the customer where it is.</p></div></div></article><article class="border-border bg-card flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border shadow-sm"><h3 class="border-border border-b px-6 py-4 text-base font-semibold tracking-tight">A connection complaint is logged</h3><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col gap-4 p-6"><div><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] text-rose-700 uppercase"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clock h-3.5 w-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"></path></svg>Today</div><p class="text-muted-foreground mt-1.5 text-sm">The complaint is written in a call-centre notebook, the field team gets it on WhatsApp, and the consumer calls back twice for an update.</p></div><div class="bg-brand-50 ring-brand-200 mt-auto rounded-xl p-4 ring-1"><div class="text-brand-800 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sparkles h-3.5 w-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z"></path><path d="M20 2v4"></path><path d="M22 4h-4"></path><circle cx="4" cy="20" r="2"></circle></svg>With <!-- -->Business Operations</div><p class="text-foreground/85 mt-1.5 text-sm">Utility Management logs the complaint against the connection master, routes the service request to the right team, and the fix shows up in the consumer&#x27;s history.</p></div></div></article></div></div></section><section class="relative isolate py-16 sm:py-24 lg:py-28"><div class="container-default"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center"><div class="mb-4 flex justify-center"><span class="chip-brand inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em]"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-foreground"></span>Connects with</span></div><h2 class="text-balance text-3xl font-semibold sm:text-4xl lg:text-[42px] lg:leading-[1.08]">Fits into the way your business already runs.</h2><p class="mt-4 text-pretty text-base text-muted-foreground sm:text-lg">Business Ope